  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Rural Development: Inclusive smallholder agriculture development project in the North-West mountains of Tunisia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project&#xbf;s objective is to contribute to inclusive socioeconomic development and the climate-resilience of vulnerable rural populations in the North-West mountains of Tunisia. The project&#xbf;s development objective is to improve the living conditions and climate-resilience of 19,375 rural households in the North-West Mountains by 2032.</narrative>
  </description>
